    <unit id="d76c3d0e-973c-495c-9991-2efa6bf9da35">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 2</note>
        <note appliesTo="source">prefix: # </note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>Window State</source>
        <target>窗口状态</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="68969784-ca2d-4478-bd56-c6400ee7f683">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 4</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>An NVDA add-on that lets you query the state of the current foreground window.</source>
        <target>一款 NVDA 插件，用于查询当前前台窗口的状态。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="9776d002-08fc-4d44-a24f-87981ae6d59d">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 6</note>
        <note appliesTo="source">prefix: ## </note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>The Problem</source>
        <target>问题</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="624c671e-c296-49d9-8f23-f13a29551983">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 8</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>NVDA doesn't tell you whether a window is maximized, restored, or snapped to a side of the screen when you query the title. This information is useful because:</source>
        <target>NVDA 在查询窗口标题时，不会告知您窗口是最大化、还原，还是贴靠到屏幕一侧。这些信息很有用，因为：</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="5c83a72d-ac83-4dd3-8447-a04ffed62d11">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 10</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>- Pressing Windows+Up Arrow to maximize a window can instead trigger the Windows 11 snap layout chooser, leaving the window in an unknown state.</source>
        <target>- 按 Windows+上光标最大化窗口时，可能触发 Windows 11 的贴靠布局选择器，使窗口处于未知状态。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="a305dbf0-315c-4f29-94e3-bad2f6a5ca52">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 11</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>- Sighted users can glance at a window to see its size and position. Blind users have no equivalent check without trying to resize and listening to what NVDA says happened.</source>
        <target>- 明眼用户只需扫一眼就能看到窗口的大小和位置。而盲人用户没有相应的核对方式，只能尝试调整窗口大小，并听 NVDA 的语音提示。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="a1f8878a-e25b-49ba-a55c-6fac0a6007db">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 12</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>- JAWS includes this information in its JAWS+T title announcement. NVDA does not.</source>
        <target>- JAWS 在其 JAWS+T 标题播报中包含了这些信息，而 NVDA 没有。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="a935f944-9e19-4028-8333-3d500628c652">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 14</note>
        <note appliesTo="source">prefix: ## </note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>What This Add-on Does</source>
        <target>此插件的作用</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="80a6623e-481f-4c01-b490-9c1b187888fb">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 16</note>
        <note appliesTo="source">prefix: 1. </note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>**NVDA+Shift+T**: Reports the state of the current foreground window. Possible states:</source>
        <target>**NVDA+Shift+T**：读出当前前台窗口的状态。可能的状态包括：</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="5ca82d8b-da89-40df-8095-56764a580dff">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 17</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>   - Maximized</source>
        <target>   - 最大化</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="570724c6-d6d3-43dc-af94-c42b1d95529f">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 18</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>   - Restored (normal windowed mode)</source>
        <target>   - 还原（普通窗口模式）</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="8a54e608-4913-46b7-8aab-0b8fec67cfc7">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 19</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>   - Minimized</source>
        <target>   - 最小化</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="af6f3546-d940-40a7-b716-db7a58810e4c">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 20</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>   - Docked left, docked right, docked top, docked bottom (half-screen snaps)</source>
        <target>   - 左侧贴靠、右侧贴靠、顶部贴靠、底部贴靠（半屏贴靠）</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="d2edd386-8430-47b2-a532-b46805f3d13d">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 21</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>   - Top left quarter, top right quarter, bottom left quarter, bottom right quarter</source>
        <target>   - 左上四分之一、右上四分之一、左下四分之一、右下四分之一</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="f9e89c49-70cb-4487-a650-546153d838c4">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 22</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="initial">
        <source>   - Not resizable (for windows like the Desktop that can't be maximized or restored)</source>
        <target>   - Not resizable (for windows like the Desktop that can't be maximized or restored)</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="0b0c126b-2b40-4a50-85a2-9f2d94499a03">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 24</note>
        <note appliesTo="source">prefix: 2. </note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>**Optional: NVDA+T enhancement**: When enabled in settings, pressing NVDA+T will announce the window title followed by the state, e.g. "Firefox, maximized." This matches the JAWS behavior. Pressing NVDA+T twice to spell the title and three times to copy it to the clipboard are not affected.</source>
        <target>**可选的 NVDA+T 增强**：在设置中启用后，按 NVDA+T 将读出窗口标题后跟状态，例如“Firefox, 最大化。”此行为与 JAWS 一致。按 NVDA+T 两次逐字朗读标题、按三次复制到剪贴板的功能不受影响。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="afafe799-5714-4d3f-93a0-328b358a986e">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 26</note>
        <note appliesTo="source">prefix: ## </note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>Settings</source>
        <target>设置</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="06b9a302-d106-47cb-aed3-c89b8ea9ff46">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 28</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>Open NVDA Settings &gt; Window State to configure:</source>
        <target>打开 NVDA 设置 &gt; 窗口状态进行配置：</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="ef5dc78d-c596-4234-b9e2-11312abc69a8">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 30</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>- **Append window state to NVDA+T title announcement**: When checked, NVDA+T includes the window state after the title. Off by default.</source>
        <target>- **按 NVDA+T 读出标题时追加窗口状态**：选中后，会在按 NVDA+T 读出标题时包含窗口状态信息。默认关闭。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="8dfafc67-1bef-4194-b4f8-21df9b58ad09">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 32</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>All commands can be remapped from NVDA's Input Gestures dialog under the "Window State" category.</source>
        <target>所有命令均可在 NVDA “按键与手势”对话框的“窗口状态”类别中重新分配。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="ac900c0c-7827-4728-af9f-3d6cb99615e2">
